  "abstract": "LayerNorm across factor dimension in the factorized-loadings oscillatory SSM (k=320,p=32) with \u03b3_end=0.995 to test late-horizon gating sensitivity. Retains residual copy, MAE+temporal curvature, and V-orthogonality (\u03bb=1e-5).",
